2 NOTE JOHN I "Lackland" Plantagenet King of England, born Dec 24, 1167 in Beaumont Palace, Oxford, England; died Oct 19, 1216 in Newark Castle, England. He was the son of HENRY II "Curtmantle" Plantagenet K
3 CONC ing England and ELEANORE Princess of Aquitaine. He married ISABELLA Taillefer of Angouleme Queen of England Aug 24, 1200 in Bordeaux, France.
